{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixer\u2019s Tale</strong> is an interactive story inspired by classic text adventures: A Research Complex stuffed with silly puzzles, obvious hazards, boilerplate conversations, minimalist design, and countless nods to sci-fi masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across five floors you\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 peculiar locations (mostly labs)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36,000 words of story (your eyes will be fine)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,000 storage containers for mysterious artifacts (all perfectly identical)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 types of chairs (for the furniture connoisseur)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 lunch break (an unforgettable meal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More references and Easter Eggs than you can count (not stolen but inspired)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, including secret ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several unique paths to finish the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The easiest IQ test in history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is <strong>Fixer\u2019s Tale</strong>. Good luck out there, fixer!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2766400/e3c78ae9b0a1db9b077e125a5b47ed42e3fab5fd.jpg"},{"name":"But something was wrong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2766400/2f2866b4aaff608bc69eb095f385de7c7a82bdf2.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks for waiting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2766400/717c202d77b96c2fc47f8dee0190e54d916c8646.jpg"},{"name":"Lost in Translation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2766400/054101af135ed3da3a7adc27c18b